{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the Caretaker of a Tiny Egg Living on Your Desktop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A relaxing idle nurturing game where you simply watch it grow!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play is Simple:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Give your egg a name, and then just watch over it.</strong><br><strong>But simply waiting isn't enough for your egg to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You need to carefully nurture it by managing its temperature and stress levels.</strong><br><strong>As time passes, cracks will begin to form on the egg...</strong><br><strong>And eventually, a Slime Monster called &quot;Slimeon&quot; will be born.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise various Slimeon and complete your collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1744721417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Completely Idle Nurturing Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The key to this game is patience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even when you're not actively playing\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>whether you're working, studying, or playing other games\u2014</strong><br><strong>As long as the game is running, your egg will slowly and automatically grow.</strong><br><strong>Experience the joy of watching life take shape, even while you're away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>However, you must be careful.</strong><br><strong>If you neglect temperature control or stress management,</strong><br><strong>Your Slimeon might fail to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To successfully raise your Slimeon, a bit of attention and care is essential.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: This game is not a clicker game.</strong><br><strong>It\u2019s all about gently watching over your egg as it grows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a-2.gif?t=1744721417\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595790?t=1744721417","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8c2369dbc50add3cc01876a92e3fab2842c84c47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744721417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8a88aae0759b463d9ea98657847b6b2f98b6f5b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744721417","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/8a88aae0759b463d9ea98657847b6b2f98b6f5b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744721417","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Become the Caretaker of a Tiny Egg Living on Your Desktop.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A relaxing idle nurturing game where you simply watch it grow!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play is Simple:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Give your egg a name, and then just watch over it.</strong><br><strong>But simply waiting isn't enough for your egg to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You need to carefully nurture it by managing its temperature and stress levels.</strong><br><strong>As time passes, cracks will begin to form on the egg...</strong><br><strong>And eventually, a Slime Monster called &quot;Slimeon&quot; will be born.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise various Slimeon and complete your collection!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1744721417\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Completely Idle Nurturing Game.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The key to this game is patience.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Even when you're not actively playing\u2014</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>whether you're working, studying, or playing other games\u2014</strong><br><strong>As long as the game is running, your egg will slowly and automatically grow.</strong><br><strong>Experience the joy of watching life take shape, even while you're away.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>However, you must be careful.</strong><br><strong>If you neglect temperature control or stress management,</strong><br><strong>Your Slimeon might fail to hatch.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>To successfully raise your Slimeon, a bit of attention and care is essential.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Note: This game is not a clicker game.</strong><br><strong>It\u2019s all about gently watching over your egg as it grows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/extras/\u540d\u79f0\u672a\u8a2d\u5b9a-2.gif?t=1744721417\" /></p>","developers":["AYUMI FUJINO","NORA"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595790/3cce26b066353ef09c2104b1f0340a877dc9ea38/header.jpg?t=1744721417","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recomme